                <invention-title lang="de">FEHLVERHALTENSWARNUNGEN IN INTELLIGENTEN TRANSPORTSYSTEMEN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">AVERTISSEMENTS DE COMPORTEMENT ERRONÉ DANS DES SYSTÈMES DE TRANSPORT INTELLIGENTS</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">MISBEHAVIOUR WARNINGS IN INTELLIGENT TRANSPORTATION SYSTEMS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The method implemented by a vehicle deploying or functioning as an intelligent transportation system, ITS, station comprises: receiving, from a network server, a misbehaviour warning message indicating that the vehicle is misbehaving; determining, in response to the misbehaviour warning message, a cause of misbehaviour of the vehicle; and sending, to the network server, an indication indicating that the cause of misbehaviour has been repaired.</p>
            </abstract>
